      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the requested files, I need to use the Azure Monitor service from Microsoft for the metrics monitoring tasks. This service provides a comprehensive solution for collecting, analyzing, and acting on telemetry from cloud and on-premises environments. The Azure Monitor SDK will be used to interact with the service. Each scored implementation file will import the necessary modules from the Azure Monitor SDK and use them to perform the required tasks. The local helper files will contain configuration loading, payload normalization, and response parsing utilities. The later-step scored files will also use the Azure Monitor SDK to perform their respective tasks. </thinking>\n",
